  "notes": "Brady drill hole collar summary (Table 6-3, page 780): 30 holes totalling 6,353.56 m in NAD27 Z21N. Huxter Lane drill hole collar summary (Table 6-1, page 863 and continued page 839, 666): 67 holes totalling 11,858.12 m in NAD27 Z21N. Planned drill holes for Reid and Mosquito Hill (Tables 26-3 and 26-4) are in NAD83 UTMZ21N but were not extracted as they are planned/proposed holes, not actual drilled collars. No downhole survey data tables were found in the provided context; all survey_points arrays are empty. Lithology intervals extracted from Table 6-2 (Significant drill intercepts, Mosquito Hill Zone, 2006-2011) represent only the first 10 rows of mineralized intercepts shown; the full table extends beyond this. Coordinate systems differ between historical drilling (NAD27 Z21N) and planned drilling (NAD83 UTMZ21N). Context notes that drill collar coordinates were converted from NAD27 to NAD83 using NTv2 transformation for the MRE, but the original collar tables retain NAD27 coordinates as printed.",
